. *-*-*-* sigma w bar hat *-*-*-*
. *within variance
. egen sig_w = mean(sig_i)

. 
. *-*-*-* sigma b bar hat *-*-*-*
. *between variance
. by id : gen sigbi = mu_i^2 - 0.5*sig_i - mu_y^2 + (1/(2*N))*sig_y
(1,749 missing values generated)

. egen sig_b = mean(sigbi)

