. egen sig_c = mean(sigci)

. 
. *-*-*-* sigma e bar hat *-*-*-*
. *excess variance estimator
. by id : gen sigei = (3/2)*sig_i - mu_i^2
(1,749 missing values generated)

. egen sig_e = mean(sigei)

